<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-VASSEUR TAKES TOUR DE FRANCE LEAD.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-VASSEUR TAKES TOUR DE FRANCE LEAD.</headline>
<dateline>LA CHATRE, France 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's Cedric Vasseur won the 261.5-km 5th stage of the Tour de France cycling race from Chantonnay to La Chatre on Thursday and took the overall leader's yellow jersey.</p>
</text>
